<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania approves Kredyt Bank application.</title>
<headline>Lithuania approves Kredyt Bank application.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's central bank said on Thursday that it had approved an application from Poland's Kredyt Bank SA to establish a branch in the Baltic state.</p>
<p>&quot;We gave Kredyt Bank permission today to establish a branch in Lithuania during our board meeting,&quot; Jonas Niaura, the deputy govenor of the Bank of Lithunia, told Reuters by telephone.</p>
</text>
